    "body": "I think I didn't consider this case when I specified this.\r\n\r\nLooking at the example URL from the bug http://plnkr.co/edit/dRFCICTNSl3V0uSu04xR?p=preview it seems Chrome and Safari scroll the outer doc, but Firefox doesn't. Correct?\r\n\r\nIt seems a bit weird to have different behavior between #top and #foobar . What do browsers do for regular fragment links?",
